sequenceDiagram
    title COMP-UC17 用户主页与关注关系——组件级顺序图
    actor User as 用户/调用方
    participant Page as UserProfile.vue / PostDetail.vue
    participant API as Axios / Vue Router
    participant Controller as UserProfileController + FollowController
    participant Service as FollowServiceImpl
    participant Dependency as UserMapper + PostMapper + FollowMapper
    participant Data as MySQL: tm_user、tm_post、tm_follow
    User->>Page: 发起“用户主页与关注关系”操作
    Page->>API: GET /api/user/profile/*；POST /api/follow/{userId}
    API->>Controller: HTTP/JSON + JWT（需要时）
    Controller->>Service: 参数、身份与业务请求
    Service->>Dependency: 执行业务规则/持久化或外部调用
    Dependency->>Data: 查询或条件写入
    alt 成功
      Data-->>Dependency: 返回数据或影响行数
      Dependency-->>Service: 返回业务结果
      Service-->>Controller: 成功结果
      Controller-->>API: Result.success(...)
      API-->>Page: 更新页面状态
      Page-->>User: 展示可验证结果
    else 关键失败
      Note over Service,Data: 用户不存在、自关注或非法访问时返回失败
      Service-->>Controller: 抛出/返回业务失败
      Controller-->>API: Result.error(...)
      API-->>Page: 展示错误且不伪造成功状态
    end
